  "prefLabel": "Puc 2602.09 Energy efficiency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2602.09 “Energy efficiency” means using less energy or energy in a different manner that results in lower net greenhouse gas emissions to provide the same level of energy service or comparable functionality.\n\nSource. #9352, INTERIM, eff 1-1-09; ss by #9615, eff 12-12-09, EXPIRED: 12-12-17",
